# Humanities Scholars: Information Needs and Uses.

**Authors:** Stone, Sue

## Abstract
Literature of information needs and uses of humanities scholars in universities is reviewed, using materials published from 1970 onwards. Areas covered include definitions of humanities, research materials, secondary services, computers, role of libraries and library services, and comparisons between humanities and other disciplines. A 174-item reference list is provided. (EJS)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ276737

